I think I was hanging out with
Bowen and we were in traffic,

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.567
and I was like
"God really got up to his

00:09:08.567 --> 00:09:10.567
tricks today with this traffic."

00:09:10.567 --> 00:09:13.267
And that just kind of came out
of my mouth, and I was like,

00:09:13.267 --> 00:09:15.067
oh, so now
when anything good or bad

00:09:15.067 --> 00:09:17.033
happens to me,
that's blind faith,

00:09:17.033 --> 00:09:18.834
that's God just getting up
to his little tricks.

00:09:18.834 --> 00:09:19.868
-Yeah.

00:09:19.868 --> 00:09:21.534
-And so I wrote
a song about that.

00:09:21.534 --> 00:09:24.067
It's in the -- it's in the style
of like a musical theater,

00:09:24.067 --> 00:09:25.634
Andrew Lloyd Webber.

00:09:25.634 --> 00:09:27.968
And "Lube For the Sleigh"
is a disco song, by the way.

00:09:27.968 --> 00:09:30.033
I know that that's --
that seemed like --

00:09:30.033 --> 00:09:31.501
-I think,
if given the choice,

00:09:31.501 --> 00:09:33.934
we would have got that right.
-Right, right, right, exactly.

00:09:33.934 --> 00:09:35.067
You're coming on my podcast.
-I am.

00:09:35.067 --> 00:09:36.067
So you mentioned Bowen.

00:09:36.067 --> 00:09:37.467
You and Bowen Yang have a --

00:09:37.467 --> 00:09:38.801
How long have you --
how many episodes

00:09:38.801 --> 00:09:39.834
have you done
of "Las Culturistas?"

00:09:39.834 --> 00:09:41.734
-Oh, God.
We're coming up on 400 episodes.

00:09:41.734 --> 00:09:43.067
-That is amazing.

00:09:43.067 --> 00:09:44.334
-Yeah.
-Congratulations.

00:09:44.334 --> 00:09:45.701
That's really, really cool.
-Thank you.

00:09:45.701 --> 00:09:48.968
And you know what's funny?
Like, we started it in 2016

00:09:48.968 --> 00:09:51.067
and we thought we were
so late on podcasts.

00:09:51.067 --> 00:09:53.033
This is so lame.
We were like, this sucks.

00:09:53.033 --> 00:09:55.000
We're doing a podcast now.
It's like over.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.434
Now, everyone was --
I was, you know, Hillary,

00:09:57.434 --> 00:09:59.501
Hillary's got a pod.

00:09:59.501 --> 00:10:00.601
-But, yeah, you guys were like

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.968
front runners on podcasts.
Congratulations.

00:10:01.968 --> 00:10:03.367
-Which we never would have
known,

00:10:03.367 --> 00:10:06.434
and by the way, it's a big deal
for you booking our pod

00:10:06.434 --> 00:10:07.734
because we don't allow
straight men on.

00:10:07.734 --> 00:10:10.734
-Really?
-No, it's you and Will Ferrell,

00:10:10.734 --> 00:10:12.434
and we had to let him on
because he begged.

00:10:12.434 --> 00:10:13.868
-Oh, wow.
-It was pathetic

00:10:13.868 --> 00:10:17.133
-Based on this, I think I know
how to talk like gay men.

00:10:17.133 --> 00:10:18.133
I'd be like, "What's up, bro?
How's it going?"

00:10:18.133 --> 00:10:19.467
Like I said...

00:10:19.467 --> 00:10:20.734
[ Laughter ]

00:10:20.734 --> 00:10:22.467
All of a sudden
I get in your DMs.

00:10:22.467 --> 00:10:24.200
-Ding, ding, ding.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.701
Hey, what a delight
to have you here.

00:10:25.701 --> 00:10:28.334
Congrats on the --.
I can't wait to do your podcast.

00:10:28.334 --> 00:10:29.734
-Matt Rogers, everybody,

00:10:29.734 --> 00:10:31.133
"Have You Heard
It's Christmas?" out now.

00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:32.300
We'll be right back
with more "Late Night.

